# Always deploy to Vercel production

Never leave site work local-only. Never ask whether to deploy. After any visual, content, or code change, publish production immediately:

```bash
npx vercel --prod --yes
```

Run from the project root. Return the production URL when done. Preview-only deploys are not enough.
